# 6 — 32 MB memtable + timer fsync (every 1s) — write breakthrough

## Server
```
cargo run --release --bin server -- \
  --addr 127.0.0.1:4321 --profile none --log-level error \
  --memtable-mb 32 --fsync-interval 1000
```

## Benchmark command
```
cargo run --bin benchmark --release -- loadgen \
  --workloads write,read,mixed,tail \
  --concurrency-min 1 --concurrency-max 16 --concurrency-step 2 \
  --duration-secs 30 --profile-mem 1000 \
  --tag latest --external-server true --addr 127.0.0.1:4321
```

